     "lakh",
     "crore",
     "million",
     "estimate"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "In the Indian system, places are ones, tens, hundreds, thousands, ten thousands, lakhs, ten lakhs and crores. 1 lakh is 1,00,000 and 1 crore is 1,00,00,000.\nIn the international system, we group in threes: 1,000,000 is one million. 10 lakh equals 1 million.\nTo estimate, round to the nearest thousand or lakh. 2,45,31,000 is about 2.5 crore."
    }
